  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 9002.06 “Alveolar air” means that portion of a breath sample submitted which is nearest in exchange between the lungs and the blood, the last portion of a maximal expiration.\n\nSource. #12556, eff 6-21-18",
